      "value": "This was difficult because it appears to be a very isolated issue. We were not able to reproduce this bug internally or find any other examples of it happening, but found a theoretical way it could potentially have occurred. We've added more layers of extra security to ensure this should be impossible in the current open beta version (2025.2.1 build 1622). We'd appreciate it if you can try to replicate the bug again on your specific machine to confirm.",
